Z||000000||Cliff Pennock||09-23-2001||07:23 PM||||Ok, this is a song I've been working on for quite some time and it's nearly finished. I'm mixing using headphones so although it sounds good on my headphones, it may actually sound like crapola through speakers. I made this using an SBLive, but I'm thinking of switching to the new Audigy card. Anyone already have some experience with this card (mainly for making music)?<P>Anyway, you can download the song (in MP3) <A HREF="http://www.pennock.nl/download/allyour.mp3" TARGET=_blank>here</A>.||||reg||1
