Z||000026||FieroHeather||09-26-2001||07:05 AM||||MonkeyMan:<P>Right click Cliff's link, and choose "Save Target As", and save it directly to your HD.  Then open up the file in the program you use most (like WinAmp, etc.) and it should work.<P>That's the trick for D/Ling most mp3s off of the internet...<P>3min 39sec from here at 21.2KB, woohoo!!  I LOVE having my network working now and having DSL on my computer!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||6
